- Repo root:
  - `README.md`
  - `.cursorrules`
  - `HCDE 530 Week 2 Project/`
    - `demo_word_count.py`
    - `demo_responses.csv`
    - `dashboard.html`
    - `count_words.py`
    - `context.md`
    - `week2.md`
    - `.gitignore`
  - `HCDE 530 Week 3 Project/`
    - `clean_week3_survey.py`
    - `week3.md`
    - `week3_analysis_fixed.py`
    - `week3_survey_messy.csv`
    - `week3_survey_cleaned.csv`
  - `HCDE 530 Week 4 Project/`
